No upstream source: this Bundler RBS stub is hand-written by
Rigor maintainers under MPL-2.0 (matching the rest of Rigor)
because the `bundler` gem ships no `sig/` and is not covered by
`ruby/gem_rbs_collection`.

The minimal `references/rbs/sig/shims/bundler.rbs` shim in the
upstream `rbs` gem (MIT) declares a smaller subset
(`LockfileParser` / `LazySpecification` / `Dependency` /
`Definition` / `default_lockfile` / `definition` /
`Source::Gemspec`); the vendored stub here is a strict superset
modelled on `references/ruby/lib/bundler.rb`'s `class << self`
block and the most-touched Bundler classes per the
`references/ruby/lib` survey
(`docs/CURRENT_WORK.md` § "Queued engine items").
